Cloudinary supports uploading media for a social media app on both Android and iOS. 
For both platforms, the usual flow is:
Create an upload preset in the Cloudinary Console (Settings → Upload → Upload presets). 
Use Cloudinary’s mobile SDKs to let users upload directly from their devices (no need to send files through your own servers). 
Optionally use the Upload Widget for a ready-made UI that supports both Android and iOS.
So you can build a simple “upload media” flow where users pick images/videos from their phone and upload straight to Cloudinary.